ool_use` and `system/*` noise, not `tool_call` — **extend shared parser, don’t share blindly**.\\n- **#17 “or fallback probe chose”** vs #4 probe **no disallowedTools fallback** — **plan-only only; strike fallback wording**.\\n- **`origin/main` `build_argv`/`supervise`** hardcode cursor-agent (`--print`, `--trust`, `backend: \\\"cursor\\\"`) vs fixture argv `claude -p --verbose --permission-mode` — **Claude backend owns argv; route by model `backend`** (#15).\\n- **Cost**: #17 `total_cost_usd` vs `finalize` `compute_cost` from table — **report backend cost; `cost_estimated=false`** (#15).\\n- **`Usage` camelCase** vs Claude result `input_tokens`/`cache_read_input_tokens` — **normalize in Claude parse path**.\\n- **#7 run unknown model exit 2** vs Claude bad-model job with stream `is_error` — **validate ids at CLI; in-run model errors  [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":487,"content":"{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"duration_ms\":78610,\"duration_api_ms\":78610,\"is_error\":false,\"result\":\"Gathering issues, rulings, origin/main code, and fixture context for the preflight.\\n### 1. Contradictions\\n- **#17 “reuse cursor parser”** vs Claude `assistant`/`tool_use` and `system/*` noise, not `tool_call` — **extend shared parser, don’t share blindly**.\\n- **#17 “or fallback probe chose”** vs #4 probe **no disallowedTools fallback** — **plan-only only; strike fallback wording**.\\n- **`origin/main` `build_argv`/`supervise`** hardcode cursor-agent (`--print`, `--trust`, `backend: \\\"cursor\\\"`) vs fixture argv `claude -p --verbose --permission-mode` — **Claude backend owns argv; route by model `backend`** (#15).\\n- **Cost**: #17 `total_cost_usd` vs `finalize` `compute_cost` from table — **report backend cost; `cost_estimated=false`** (#15).\\n- **`Usage` camelCase** vs Claude result `input_tokens`/`cache_read_input_tokens` — **normalize in Claude parse path**.\\n- **#7 run unknow [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-16.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":28,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_8e35bc49-6319-4c72-b7a4-f8d76f8873b\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 16 --comments && echo '---' && gh issue view 4 --comments && for n in 7 9 10 11 12 13; do echo \\\"=== ISSUE $n ===\\\"; gh issue view $n --comments; done\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_8e35bc49-6319-4c72-b7a4-f8d76f8873b\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"16\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 16 --comments\"},{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"raw_string\",\"value\":\"'---'\"} [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-15.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":28,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 15 --comments 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"---\\\"; gh issue view 4 --comments 2>/dev/null\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":true,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"15\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 15 --comments\"},{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"---\\\"\"}],\"fullText\":\"echo \\\"---\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"ty [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":311,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" permission_denials \",\"session_id\":\"7dd612d0-6469-4d8d-870b-f50c14f3831a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790845618242}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":347,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"\\n\\nThe 250-word budget is roughly fifteen to twenty one-line contradictions. The fixture comparison will sit outside that limit. The claude fixture carries system and hook_ events, plus total_cost_usd and permission_denials in the result line. The cursor fixture uses a different type field.\",\"session_id\":\"7dd612d0-6469-4d8d-870b-f50c14f3831a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790845618243}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":514,"content":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"**1. Contradictions**  \\n- #15 is blocked by #13, but `__supervise` on origin/main still runs `JobRegistry`; #13 says the supervisor must not use it — **implement #13 supervisor first, then split backends.**  \\n- #15 puts doctor on each backend; #11 owns `delegate doctor` — **backend exposes probe hooks only; CLI stays in #11.**  \\n- #15 asks for a normalized parser result; finalize still uses `RawCursorJson` and `output.rs` STATUS parsing (#7) — **keep `BackendResult`; do not move STATUS derivation into the backend.**  \\n- `cli.rs` calls `build_argv`, `map_capability`, and `cursor_bin` — violates the encapsulation AC — **move argv, capability flags, and bin resolution into `backends/cursor`.**  \\n- `capability.rs` still maps removed Plan/Write modes — **delete non-spec capabilities in the same lane or cursor backend ignores them.**\\n\\n**2. Unstated defaults**  \\n- Shape of the backend trait (`run` only [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":515,"content":"{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"duration_ms\":74677,\"duration_api_ms\":74677,\"is_error\":false,\"result\":\"Gathering issues, spec comments, owner rulings, and relevant code on origin/main.\\n\\n\\n**1. Contradictions**  \\n- #15 is blocked by #13, but `__supervise` on origin/main still runs `JobRegistry`; #13 says the supervisor must not use it — **implement #13 supervisor first, then split backends.**  \\n- #15 puts doctor on each backend; #11 owns `delegate doctor` — **backend exposes probe hooks only; CLI stays in #11.**  \\n- #15 asks for a normalized parser result; finalize still uses `RawCursorJson` and `output.rs` STATUS parsing (#7) — **keep `BackendResult`; do not move STATUS derivation into the backend.**  \\n- `cli.rs` calls `build_argv`, `map_capability`, and `cursor_bin` — violates the encapsulation AC — **move argv, capability flags, and bin resolution into `backends/cursor`.**  \\n- `capability.rs` still maps removed Plan/Write modes — **delete non-spec capabilities in the same [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-13.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":31,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_fca866d8-f4d2-4eae-9395-d1e67484877\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd